@startuml
' archifiltre-docs subset: settings sanitization, exports, hash processing
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8

title archifiltre-docs (subset) — Settings, Exports, Hashing

rectangle "Electron Desktop Application" as Electron {
  [Settings Sanitizer] as SettingsSanitizer
  [Export Controller] as ExportController
  [Hash Controller] as HashController
  [Translation Module] as I18n
}

[Background Worker Infra\n(Worker/Child Process)] as WorkerInfra

package "Export Workers" {
  [Tree CSV Export Worker] as TreeWorker
  [RESIP Export Worker] as ResipWorker
  [CSV Export Worker] as CsvWorker
  [Excel Export Worker] as ExcelWorker
}

package "Hashing" {
  [Hash Batch Processor] as HashBatch
}

folder "App User Data Directory\napp.getPath(\"userData\")" as UserDataDir
artifact "hash-result-debug" as DebugResult
artifact "hash-error-debug" as DebugError

package "Export Inputs" {
  [Files & Folders Map] as FilesMap
  [Files/Folders Metadata] as FFMeta
  [Aliases] as Aliases
  [Comments] as Comments
  [Tags] as Tags
  [Hashes] as Hashes
  [CsvExporterData] as CsvExporterData
}

package "Hash Inputs" {
  [paths[]] as Paths
  [basePath] as BasePath
}

' Settings sanitization
[Persisted Settings] as Persisted
[Normalized Settings] as Normalized
Persisted --> SettingsSanitizer : persisted values
SettingsSanitizer --> Normalized : defaults on empty/invalid\n- isTrackingEnabled=true\n- isMonitoringEnabled=true\n- language="en"\n(FR-001, FR-002)

note right of SettingsSanitizer
- Replace invalid values; preserve valid ones
end note

' Language propagation
I18n --> ExportController : current language

' Export inputs into controller
FilesMap --> ExportController : Tree CSV input (FR-003)
Aliases --> ExportController
Comments --> ExportController
Tags --> ExportController
FFMeta --> ExportController
Hashes --> ExportController
CsvExporterData --> ExportController

' Background worker invocation
ExportController --> WorkerInfra : invoke background workers (NFR-001)
WorkerInfra --> TreeWorker
WorkerInfra --> ResipWorker
WorkerInfra --> CsvWorker
WorkerInfra --> ExcelWorker

' Controller -> workers with required context
ExportController --> TreeWorker : files map + language (FR-003, FR-004)
ExportController --> ResipWorker : files, metadata, aliases, comments, tags (FR-005)
ExportController --> CsvWorker : export data + language (FR-006)
ExportController --> ExcelWorker : CsvExporterData + language (FR-007)

' Workers emit asynchronous results (Observable/stream-like)
TreeWorker --> ExportController : Observable(progress updates, final tree CSV) (FR-003)
ResipWorker --> ExportController : Observable(progress counts + empty CSV, final CSV) (FR-005)
CsvWorker --> ExportController : Observable(CSV export) (FR-006)
ExcelWorker --> ExportController : Observable(Excel export) (FR-007)

note right of TreeWorker
- Emits computation updates\n- Final export string emitted last
end note

note right of ResipWorker
- In-progress results: counts + empty RESIP CSV\n- Completion: final RESIP CSV\n- Controller filters + maps result payload
end note

' Hashing workflow
Paths --> HashController : paths (FR-008)
BasePath --> HashController : basePath (FR-008)
HashController --> HashBatch : batch(paths, basePath) (FR-008, NFR-002)
HashBatch --> HashController : stream(hash maps) (FR-008)

HashController --> UserDataDir : open debug writers (FR-009, NFR-004)
UserDataDir -- DebugResult
UserDataDir -- DebugError
HashController --> DebugResult : write results (FR-009)
HashController --> DebugError : write errors (FR-009)

note bottom of HashController
- Aggregates batch hash results into merged hash maps
end note

@enduml
